There are many clothes in the shop.
I choose some clothes.
Then I go into the fitting room.
I have a small pile of clothes.
First of all I pick up a beautiful kurta.
This kurta is blue.
I always wear a large size.
I put on this blue kurta.
This cotton fabric is very soft.
I look in the mirror.
This large kurta looks very good on me.
Then I look at its price.
It is not expensive, it is affordable.
The price of this kurta is only six hundred rupees.
Six hundred rupees is a good price.
I like it.
I buy this blue kurta.
